					<!-- p class="post-info">Jun 1st, 2009 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
					<p class="post-meta"><ul class='post-meta'>
<li><span class='post-meta-key'>Birth Date:</span> June 7, 1952</li>
<li><span class='post-meta-key'>Urs date:</span> December 21, 2006</li>
</ul>
